<title>CROATIA: Croatia Nov trade deficit $399 mln vs Oct $367 mln.</title>
<headline>Croatia Nov trade deficit $399 mln vs Oct $367 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MERCHANDISE TRADE    NOV '96    OCT '96     NOV '95</p>
<p> Balance (million USD)	   -399	 -367	  -275</p>
<p> Exports				458	  332	   427</p>
<p> Imports				857	  699	   702</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
